# American English: only the lines that differ from English. The rest is English.

settings-plugins-help = Plugins add to Trindle. A plugin can add an icon to the ring, settings here, notifications, or something that starts when you log in. Each plugin runs in its own box and can't use anything until you allow it in Permissions. The button beside the page title opens Permissions. To remove a plugin, press the trash can on its card twice.
